{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-3","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：棱锥与棱柱","englishTitle":"Any pyramid which has a triangular base is divided into two pyramids equal and similar to one another, similar to the whole and having triangular bases, and into two equal prisms; and the two prisms are greater than the half of the whole pyramid.","book":12,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","contentId":"euclid-12-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41cd91eee8da7969c137733e1aba1ff5c45dd3122e39a74330b0f9804482a0e0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-3.statement","euclid-12-3.construction.1","euclid-12-3.construction.2","euclid-12-3.proof.1","euclid-12-3.proof.2","euclid-12-3.proof.3","euclid-12-3.proof.4","euclid-12-3.proof.5","euclid-12-3.proof.6","euclid-12-3.proof.7","euclid-12-3.proof.8","euclid-12-3.proof.9","euclid-12-3.proof.10","euclid-12-3.proof.11","euclid-12-3.proof.12","euclid-12-3.proof.13","euclid-12-3.proof.14","euclid-12-3.proof.15","euclid-12-3.proof.16","euclid-12-3.proof.17","euclid-12-3.proof.18","euclid-12-3.proof.19","euclid-12-3.proof.20","euclid-12-3.proof.21","euclid-12-3.proof.22","euclid-12-3.proof.23","euclid-12-3.proof.24","euclid-12-3.proof.25","euclid-12-3.proof.26","euclid-12-3.proof.27","euclid-12-3.conclusion","euclid-12-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7acf467703d9f85948fbd082339ed4f69317cadc928c18b82ab5592753306b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Any pyramid which has a triangular base is divided into two pyramids equal and similar to one another, similar to the whole and having triangular bases, and into two equal prisms; and the two prisms are greater than the half of the whole pyramid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何具有三角底边的金字塔,都分为两个等同和相似的金字塔,一个类似整个,另一个具有三角底边,另一个则具有两个等同棱镜;两个棱镜大于整个金字塔的一半。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1724a79388f7fb62c5f297d81868646288d5b024ee6ffaec9038e117f462b6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be a pyramid of which the triangle ABC is the base and the point D the vertex; I say that the pyramid ABCD is divided into two pyramids equal to one another, having triangular bases and similar to the whole pyramid, and into two equal prisms; and the two prisms are greater than the half of the whole pyramid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABC是底边,顶点D,我要说金字塔ABCD是两个等同的金字塔,三角形底边和整个金字塔相似,两个等相;两个棱镜大于整个金字塔的一半。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dfdb3f1fee0307bcf4a3ac76e99589191a976ec421da62c179b32b083ce7dba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB, BC, CA, AD, DB, DC be bisected at the points E, F, G, H, K, L, and let HE, EG, GH, HK, KL, LH, KF, FG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB, BC, CA, AD, DB, DC, 在E, F, G, H, K, L点被分成两部分HE,EG,GH,HK,KL,LH,KF,FG连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b27d983a3a7c54f90e55def6a7f3cadc7c58266ea4af853f3bad33666335da8f","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AE is equal to EB, and AH to DH, therefore EH is parallel to DB. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AE等于EB和AH至DH项因此,EH与DB并行。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29882bff797d67dc1ec81d91df64fbdc1106a69b548314e108a911170ab68766","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason HK is also parallel to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,HK也与AB并行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2ce2f2287f699989bcad3a426ba1cfc5d84b3b6df81c9720d6968c78cb90248","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore HEBK is a parallelogram; therefore HK is equal to EB. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HEBK是平行四边形;HK等于EB。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc07350957b40555970da95c19e89ca604c13516eee82a9616e5b815cb66910b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EB is equal to EA; therefore AE is also equal to HK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EB等于EA,因此AE也等于HK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a11aa5e4d90532dc37d1c7a317045a71108ebf9113b91ec85a170c969ac00587","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AH is also equal to HD; therefore the two sides EA, AH are equal to the two sides KH, HD respectively, and the angle EAH is equal to the angle KHD; therefore the base EH is equal to the base KD. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AH也等于HD;因此,双方EA、AH等于双方KH、HD,EAH角等于KHD角;因此,底边、EH等于底边、KD。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67d0792cbd1b6fc33a3aa06ebc691fdf25f734c72fabf01ddaabdb8e827c7c5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle AEH is equal and similar to the triangle HKD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形AEH等于和三角形HKD相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de62ed0601df483f14d184398cb41e3713ab7e43a4b241b86ef8ecabfedb0698","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle AHG is also equal and similar to the triangle HLD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形AHG也等于和三角形HLD相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"439ce746099c2d7899974aeaac5d16f2a59952028054c04a39fcb1e16ec7316f","citations":["euclid-11-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since two straight lines EH, HG meeting one another are parallel to two straight lines KD, DL meeting one another, and are not in the same plane, they will contain equal angles. [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于两条直线EH,HG 相互相交的线 与两条直线KD,DL 相互相交的线是平行的, 并且不是在同一平面, 它们包含相同的角度。 [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c39ca03add9318f81c317c46cf979f98e3f9d414cc25b5e17fccf2c46dc42fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle EHG is equal to the angle KDL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EHG角等于KDL角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"968cb9392cabf561ad7622ded733ab22637c97ad8e9e5d692b768e838ba75e48","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two straight lines EH, HG are equal to the two KD, DL respectively, and the angle EHG is equal to the angle KDL, therefore the base EG is equal to the base KL; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the triangle EHG is equal and similar to the triangle KDL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于两条直线EH,HG分别等于两条KD,DL,而角度EHG等于角度KDL,因此底边,EG等于角度底边,KL;因此三角形EHG等于和三角形KDL相似。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"619c9c4efdef11227b94198f3a381ab0882fbe03594098160a9773f1c03157ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle AEG is also equal and similar to the triangle HKL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形AEG也等于和三角形HKL相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ea45aafa36aa1fde854d2badb7daabe076b21db2a8d74a9ec118917f1f539c3","citations":["euclid-11-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pyramid of which the triangle AEG is the base and the point H the vertex is equal and similar to the pyramid of which the triangle HKL is the base and the point D the vertex. [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形AEG是底边,顶部H是等同的金字塔,与三角形HKL是底边,顶部D类似。 [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe0d22085fbb3652bf737b3562107d25b7969291031060fef0d3181094f94b90","citations":["euclid-1-29","euclid-6-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since HK has been drawn parallel to AB, one of the sides of the triangle ADB, the triangle ADB is equiangular to the triangle DHK, [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] and they have their sides proportional; therefore the triangle ADB is similar to the triangle DHK. [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HK是平行的AB, 三角的侧面是ADB, 三角的三角形ADB是DHK, 它们有它们的侧面是成比例, 所以三角形ADB与三角形DHK相似。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3845bb90c5f427af57d80b4d7a1eaa3f097b61181ab9fc839c1ec374408dfd77","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the triangle DBC is also similar to the triangle DKL, and the triangle ADC to the triangle DLH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,三角形DBC也与三角形DKL和三角形ADC和三角形DLH相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18e541751181718bfe1f2cb27d75b90335ad3ad0673fd88c01b6073aa16973cb","citations":["euclid-11-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two straight lines BA, AC meeting one another are parallel to the two straight lines KH, HL meeting one another, not in the same plane, they will contain equal angles. [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,既然两条直线BA,AC 相互相交的线 和两条直线KH,HL 相互相交的线平行, 而不是在同一平面, 它们将包含相同的角度。 [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"455ac0a1e56baa20f42edb4333bdb14769afb1e480a837fd65fb3e0f696bb02a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle BAC is equal to the angle KHL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BAC角等于KHL角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"105641404a1fe1179e047a23b31b57bceb52641091e3e03a856f897c8419995d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as BA is to AC, so is KH to HL; therefore the triangle ABC is similar to the triangle HKL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA比AC等于KH比HL,因此三角形ABC与三角形HKL相似；BA 与 AC 之比等于 KH 与 HL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90e5731320e4d0bc78e3e28ec1a5edaabefc803676d6b9f710d965fe7846eb00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also the pyramid of which the triangle ABC is the base and the point D the vertex is similar to the pyramid of which the triangle HKL is the base and the point D the vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,还有金字塔,其中三角ABC是底边,顶部D与金字塔相似,三角HKL是底边,顶部D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80cf6e907adbf4ccca34530848f071b4f316b95a8ed7536f2dfea4aecdfb2a7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the pyramid of which the triangle HKL is the base and the point D the vertex was proved similar to the pyramid of which the triangle AEG is the base and the point H the vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但金字塔的三角形HKL是底边,顶部D 被证明与金字塔相似, 三角形AEG是底边, 点H是顶部。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5aacbd981129b3721bfb866ddea2e066488d3ed950162631f549eb829d178b5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the pyramids AEGH, HKLD is similar to the whole pyramid ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,金字塔AEGH,HKLD 与整个金字塔ABCD相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b5009dfef43ba0e994feda202835e99f56d8399ce0f47803113d5cfe6c7cfd1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since BF is equal to FC, the parallelogram EBFG is double of the triangle GFC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,BF等于FC,平行四边形、EBFG是三角GFC的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f30e73b84f6b666a9bdbd21357412968f3c7049e895b78054e87f11ce99fa404","citations":["euclid-11-39"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, if there be two prisms of equal height, and one have a parallelogram as base, and the other a triangle, and if the parallelogram be double of the triangle, the prisms are equal, [[XI. 39](/principles/euclid-11-39)] therefore the prism contained by the two triangles BKF, EHG, and the three parallelograms EBFG, EBKH, HKFG is equal to the prism contained by the two triangles GFC, HKL and the three parallelograms KFCL, LCGH, HKFG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且,如果两个棱镜的高度相等, 一个是平行四边形, 另一个是三角, 如果平行四边形是三角的两倍, 棱镜是相等的, 那么, 由两个三角组成的棱镜 BKF, EHG, 和三个平行四边形, EBFG, EBKH, HKFG, 等于由两个三角组成的棱镜 GFC, HKL和三个三角组成的 330,KFCL, LCGH, HKFG。 [[XI. 39](/principles/euclid-11-39)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84a14e095ee288cbfa3e91f59d9ab331af184a4cd11ddcd8495d172a57928f14","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is manifest that each of the prisms, namely that in which the parallelogram EBFG is the base and the straight line HK is its opposite, and that in which the triangle GFC is the base and the triangle HKL its opposite, is greater than each of the pyramids of which the triangles AEG, HKL are the bases and the points H, D the vertices, inasmuch as, if we join the straight lines EF, EK, the prism in which the parallelogram EBFG is the base and the straight line HK its opposite is greater than the pyramid of which the triangle EBF is the base and the point K the vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"显而易见,每条棱柱,即平行四边形 EBFG是底边,HK直线是相反的,而三角GFC是底边,三角HKL是相反的,都大于金字塔中的每一个,其中三角AEG,HKL是底边,D点是顶峰,例如,如果我们连接直线EF,EK,平行四边形 EBFG是底边,HK直线是相反的。大于金字塔,其中三角形EBF是底边,点K是顶端。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0681529796367fa8948d9f3318e8554dbe1aef82f42c9339ab1a98d926301096","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the pyramid of which the triangle EBF is the base and the point K the vertex is equal to the pyramid of which the triangle AEG is the base and the point H the vertex; for they are contained by equal and similar planes."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但金字塔的三角形EBF是底边,顶点K等于金字塔,三角形AEG是底边,顶点H,因为其形成相同和相似平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9656fc35c10c261e144a04f7f9d998599cbe121f38258640ffb0d88fd21f065f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence also the prism in which the parallelogram EBFG is the base and the straight line HK its opposite is greater than the pyramid of which the triangle AEG is the base and the point H the vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平行四边形 EBFG是底边,HK直线的反面大于金字塔,其中三角AEG是底边,点H是顶端。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84c33999aeacba86f41347865194426c2a20be274d7fbee01820caa784db92c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the prism in which the parallelogram EBFG is the base and the straight line HK its opposite is equal to the prism in which the triangle GFC is the base and the triangle HKL its opposite, and the pyramid of which the triangle AEG is the base and the point H the vertex is equal to the pyramid of which the triangle HKL is the base and the point D the vertex."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,平行四边形 EBFG是底边的棱镜,HK直线的对面线是GFC三角的对面线,GFC三角是底边,HKL三角是HKL,金字塔是AEG,H点是顶部的对面线,金字塔是HKL,HKL三角是底边,D点是顶部的对面线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44fd7c62d3dda035b5f623d789c3d45c0e7710f9f83a1e538558d486d5c12518","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the said two prisms are greater than the said two pyramids of which the triangles AEG, HKL are the bases and the points H, D the vertices."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,上述两个棱镜大于上述两个金字塔,其中三角形AEG,HKL是底边,点H,D是顶峰。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":30,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb8f41bf216977b00cfdcd23254e598249c73ef461dfb83010d34105f9230e1e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole pyramid, of which the triangle ABC is the base and the point D the vertex, has been divided into two pyramids equal to one another and into two equal prisms, and the two prisms are greater than the half of the whole pyramid. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个金字塔,其中三角形ABC是底边,顶端点D, 被分为两个等同的金字塔和两个等同棱镜, 这两棱镜大于整个金字塔的一半。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-3.source","contentId":"euclid-12-3","revisionId":"euclid-12-3@raw-41cd91eee8da7969","order":31,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25fed3ae2a906cf0ba83df4bc4d1455eddcebd6469141a08232216e5347e92bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-6-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"VI. 2"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.5","euclid-12-3.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-11-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.8","euclid-12-3.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"XI. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-11-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-3:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-3.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseu